T:Hark The Herald Angels Sing
R:March
C:Felix Mendelssohn, 1840
O:Germany
Z:Paul Hardy's Xmas Tunebook 2019 (see www.paulhardy.net). Creative Commons cc by-nc-sa licenced.
M:4/4
